---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Placeholder from '@/components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Shiftify website disclaimer — indicative pricing, partner-network disclosure and content accuracy notes." canonicalPath="/disclaimer/">
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose-sfx">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem);letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-bottom:6px">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--color-slate-400)">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <h2>Indicative pricing</h2>
    <p>Shiftify does not publish price tables or calculators on this website. A binding price exists only in a written quotation issued after a survey; anything discussed by phone or WhatsApp before that survey is provisional guidance, not a quotation.</p>

    <h2>Operating model</h2>
    <p>Shiftify operates a hybrid model: own supervisor-led crews in our core areas and a vetted partner network elsewhere. Partner-delivered jobs still run on Shiftify's documentation, standards and escalation process — but we disclose the model because you deserve to know who will stand at your door.</p>

    <h2>Local information</h2>
    <p>City pages describe local rules (society permissions, vehicle restrictions, seasonality) from operational experience. These rules change; the building or authority in question is the final word on any given day.</p>

    <h2>Placeholders</h2>
    <p>This site marks incomplete business facts with a visible dashed token like <Placeholder label="EXAMPLE" /> rather than inventing them. If you spot one in production, that's deliberate honesty — and it's on our fix list.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
